@startuml
<style>
root {
  FontName SansSerif
  Shadowing 0
}
element {
  Shadowing 0
}
sequenceDiagram {
  participant {
    Padding 10
  }
  arrow {
    HorizontalAlignment center
  }
}
</style>
participant Application as app
participant "Graph layer" as graph
participant "Lower Vulkan® chain" as lower
app -> graph : vkUpdateDescriptorSets()\ntensor views
graph -> graph : Track views; update existing mappings
app -> graph : vkCmdBindPipeline()\nvkCmdBindDescriptorSets()
app -> graph : vkCmdDispatchDataGraphARM(session)
graph -> graph : Resolve external compute descriptors\non first use; reuse on later use
graph -> graph : Merge constants + intermediates\n+ external descriptors
loop ordered compute operations
graph -> lower : Bind pipeline / descriptors\nPush constants; tensor barriers\nCompute dispatches
end
graph --> app : recording returns
app -> lower : Submit command buffer later
@enduml
